        "TileImage": "$($repository e1c8c0a5-a506-45b6-9567-7b6df50b8877).Image",
        "Description": "You live a life as an average dude. You have a wife, 2 kids and a reliable job as a trusted security guard. One night you arrive home later because you had to work extra hours. As you walk through the house you notice your family gone. On the table you find a note with an address. It leads you to a warehouse where 2 guys in black suits demand you to kill Omar Al-Ghazali in the upcoming event in Dubai. If you decline they kill your family. You tear up infront of them. You don&apos;t have a choice.",
